# World -1 room 2 (Save Point), for `NATHAN_MINUS_ONE=2 scripts/record-run --capture`.
# The arrival crash aims at the one-way floor (resume). Hop on the ground pad, jump into the
# checkpoint hanging overhead: it freezes to save, the save screen is corrupted too, aimed at
# the pad's ground. Blank it: the goal's box goes with it.
wait 1.5
tap Enter
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.4
hold Right Space 300ms
wait 0.4
hold Space 300ms
wait 1.5
repeat 3
  tap Down
  wait 0.4
end
wait 0.4
tap Enter
wait 1.2
hold Right 2.5
wait 3
